<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa to make order announcement today.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa to make order announcement today.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG said it planned on Thursday to make an announcement in connection with potential orders for aircraft built by the U.S.'s McDonnell Douglas Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;We are making a press announcement about this at 1600 hours local time in Farnborough (England),&quot; a Lufthansa spokeswoman said by telephone, adding that she could give no further details before then.</p>
</text>
